  ['A responsible next-step checklist', `Before acting, review the source ID, your selected option, quantity, current visible amount and the exact question you wanted answered. Then inspect the live information relevant to the stage: marketplace and order details for a purchase request, order-specific media for a warehouse question, or current route and policy information for a parcel. Keep the order and parcel identifiers after submission so later questions refer to the correct record.

