LitBuy publicly describes ordering from Taobao, Weidian and 1688 by pasting a product link into its order flow. That makes the live item page the decision point, while the spreadsheet remains the discovery layer. Use the spreadsheet to reduce search time, then confirm the title, option, quantity and current amount in the order flow. If one detail differs from your note, pause rather than assuming the old record is still correct.

