  {label:'Article 04 · Product links',title:'LitBuy Product Links: A Better Checklist for Taobao, Weidian and 1688',description:'A new step-by-step article for checking a marketplace link before using an agent order flow.',keywords:'Primary keyword: LitBuy product links · Related: Taobao link, Weidian link, 1688 link',content:`A marketplace link identifies a live listing; it is not a permanent product specification. LitBuy publicly states that shoppers can use Taobao, Weidian and 1688 links in its ordering process. That makes the link valuable, but it does not freeze the title, options, price, photos or inventory at the moment you first save it. A careful buyer treats the link as a reference that must be checked again at the live stage.

