Use an internal catalogue for discovery and comparison. It is a useful place to search by title, category or ID and to keep a shortlist. Then move to the current product information for the current decision. Compare the saved note with the live title, option name, quantity and price one field at a time. If any field differs, do not assume the difference is harmless; decide whether to update the note, ask a precise question or choose another product.

