  {label:'Article 06 · Product categories',title:'LitBuy Product Categories: Find Products Without Losing the Original Record',description:'A new category-search guide for moving from broad browsing to an exact product reference.',keywords:'Primary keyword: LitBuy product categories · Related: LitBuy shoes, clothing, accessories, finds',content:`Categories are navigation tools. They make a large source catalogue easier to search, but they do not certify a seller, confirm material, prove fit or guarantee availability. Use a broad category when you know the type of item you want; use All Products when you have a product ID or unusual title fragment. The purpose is to reduce the number of possible records before you check the original details.

