For an order-specific QC stage, compare the visible item with the precise option you recorded: size, colour, configuration and quantity. If an image does not show the point that matters, do not manufacture confidence from a nearby view. Keep a focused question with the order ID and selected variant so the relevant current support or policy route can identify the exact record.

