  {label:'Article 08 · Parcel submission',title:'LitBuy Parcel Submission: A Pre-Shipping Checklist That Starts at the Warehouse',description:'A new practical guide for checking warehouse items before creating an international parcel.',keywords:'Primary keyword: LitBuy parcel submission · Related: warehouse items, combined shipping, international parcel',content:`Parcel submission should begin before the final button. Create a warehouse inventory with each order’s product ID, description, quantity, status and any unresolved note from inspection. Compare that list with the items you intended to ship. This step sounds basic, but it prevents the costly confusion of sending a parcel without an expected item, overlooking a duplicate, or forgetting that a visible question has not yet been answered.

