  {label:'Article 10 · Returns and after-sales',title:'LitBuy Returns and After-Sales: Ask the Right Questions Before a Parcel Leaves',description:'A new policy-first guide to documenting a concern and checking the current after-sales path.',keywords:'Primary keyword: LitBuy return policy · Related: LitBuy refund, exchange, after-sales',content:`After-sales questions are most useful when they begin with a current order and a precise issue. LitBuy publishes refund and returns or exchanges information, but any possible outcome can depend on the item, seller conditions, order stage, timing and current policy. A category page, old screenshot or general comment cannot approve a return, refund or exchange. The live policy and order information remain the reference for the case in front of you.

